From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:18:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add calendar tab with month card and day details

Calendar becomes the fourth bottom tab (after Home/Upcoming, before
Settings) with its own top app bar and no FAB. The month card follows
Tilla's 7-column layout, but keeps the day number above a small tinted
service icon so daily expenses cannot erase the whole month. Adjacent
days dim and switch month, swipes use the same ~100 px threshold, and
the day list reuses the Tilla card styling. Calendar(2) is appended to
DefaultTab so persisted values 0/1 keep working.
---
